OL,3,GNEWSACouncil-run children's home
OL,4,Aproposed to meet needs
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarly plans are under way to set up a
OL,7,Fsmall council-run children's home, a
OL,8,Flocal authority has said.
OL,10,FMembers of Peterborough City Council's
OL,11,Fcabinet are being asked to support the
OL,12,Fproposal at a meeting on Thursday.
OL,14,FThe council said it was getting more
OL,15,Fdifficult to find suitable care
OL,16,Fplacements, particularly for older
OL,17,Fchildren and those with complex needs,
OL,18,Fand a new children's home would help
OL,19,Fprovide local "safe and high-quality"
OL,20,Fcare.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
